  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Domain and range, function evaluation, transformations, and the exponential and logarithmic families.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Functions & transformations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\( y=f(x-h)+k \\) shifts a graph \\( h \\) right and \\( k \\) up. A logarithm inverts an exponential: \\( \\log_b x=y\\iff b^{y}=x \\). The domain excludes values that break the rule (e.g. negative under a square root).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Shift the V-shaped graph \\( y=|x-h|+k \\) below. Its corner — the vertex — sits exactly at \\( (h,k) \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Graph transformations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvasId": "tahTransCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "The graph of y equals absolute value of x minus h plus k, with adjustable shifts",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "tahTransDataBtn",
          "panelId": "tahTransDataPanel",
          "descId": "tahTransDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "tahTransDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Sampled points on |x| and its shifted version",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "|x|",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "g(x)",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "tahH",
            "valueDisplayId": "tahHV",
            "label": {
              "en": "Horizontal <b>h =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Horizontal h",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -4,
            "max": 4,
            "value": 0,
            "step": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "tahK",
            "valueDisplayId": "tahKV",
            "label": {
              "en": "Vertical <b>k =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Vertical k",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -4,
            "max": 4,
            "value": 0,
            "step": 1
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [
          {
            "id": "tahVertex",
            "label": {
              "en": "vertex (h, k)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "amber"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "The faint grey graph is the parent \\( y=|x| \\); the indigo one is the shifted version.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Transformation",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( f(x-h)+k \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Logarithm",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\log_b x=y\\iff b^{y}=x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Exponent law",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( b^{m}b^{n}=b^{m+n} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Inverse",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "swap \\( x \\) and \\( y \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve \\( 2^{x}=8 \\). \\[ 2^{3}=8\\Rightarrow x=3. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "State the domain of \\( \\sqrt{x-2} \\). \\[ x\\ge 2. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Let \\(f(x)=x^2-4\\) and \\(g(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}.\\) Find \\((g\\circ f)(x)\\) and its domain. <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>\\((g\\circ f)(x)=g(f(x))=\\sqrt{(x^2-4)+4}=\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|.\\) Domain: all real \\(x\\) (since \\(x^2\\ge0\\) always). So domain \\(=\\mathbb{R}.\\)</div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
